# Database (`packages/db`)

Local file libSQL only. Stay on `drizzle-orm` 0.45. Do not add Postgres,
Prisma, Turso Cloud, `better-sqlite3`, or `pg`.

```text
Hono → drizzle-orm/libsql → @libsql/client → file:…/agentic-kanban.db
```

- Open lazily (`getDb()` / proxied `db`) so Docker volumes exist before the
  first query. Do not connect at import time.
- Host default: `file:<repo>/data/agentic-kanban.db`. Compose:
  `DATABASE_URL=file:/data/agentic-kanban.db` bind-mounted from `./data`.
- `pingDatabase()` is `SELECT 1` and retries once after a stale handle.
- Schema: Better Auth tables (`src/schema/auth.ts`: `user`, `session`,
  `account`, `verification`) plus the tenant tables `workspace` and
  `workspace_member` (`workspace.ts`, unique `(workspace_id, user_id)`, no
  role), `project` (`project.ts`) and the board tables `column` and `task`
  (`board.ts`, each with its own `workspace_id`), plus `comment` (`comment.ts`,
  index `(task_id, created_at)`) and `notification` (`notification.ts`: recipient
  and actor FK to `user`, `comment_id` NOT NULL, `kind` enum `mention` guarded by
  CHECK `notification_kind_check`, nullable `read_at`/`emailed_at`, index
  `(recipient_user_id, created_at)`). Deleting a task cascades to its comments
  and notifications (and a comment to its notifications). Board queries live in
  `queries/board.ts` with the `*ForMember` suffix (membership join on the row's
  `workspace_id`; create, delete and move run in `getDb().transaction`). One file per
  aggregate, re-exported from `schema/index.ts` and `src/index.ts`.
- Foreign keys use `onDelete: "cascade"` and each FK column is indexed: its own
  `<table>_<column>_idx`, or as the leading column of a composite index
  (`<table>_<cols>_idx`) or unique. libSQL enforces FKs (`PRAGMA foreign_keys` is 1), so
  deletes never leave orphans.
- `position` (integer, CHECK >= 0) has no UNIQUE: reordering happens inside a
  transaction and uniqueness would break midway. Use non-unique composite
  indexes: `(project_id, position)` on `column`, `(column_id, position)` on
  `task`, plus `workspace_id` on both.
- Every tenant-owned query must include an authorized `workspace_id`.
- Do not auto-run migrations or seed (the seed lives in `apps/api/src/seed.ts`, writes only via upserts in `queries/seed.ts`: no DELETE). `db:generate` runs on the host;
  `migrations/` is versioned (drizzle-kit's `meta/*.json` is excluded from
  formatting, do not format it). Apply with `docker compose exec api bun run
  db:migrate`. Never commit `*.db`.
